## PR Description
Adds Redis-backed sliding window rate limiting with:
- Atomic Lua script for thread-safe counter management
- Per-IP tracking with configurable cost per endpoint
- Fail-open behavior (allows requests if Redis is unavailable)
- X-RateLimit headers (RFC 6585 compliant)
- Comprehensive test suite with ioredis-mock

